{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KILL THEM ALL AND NEVER STOP!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blimblau: Kill Them All!</i> is a <strong>retro-style Boomer Shooter FPS</strong> inspired by the classics of the \u201890s. Developed by a single indie dev, it delivers pure fast-paced action, violent combat, and gritty pixelated 2.5D/3D graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll face endless waves of <strong>modified humans</strong>, their origin unknown, coming at you without rest. Blast your way through, tear them apart, and survive the bloodbath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>: uncover, step by step, the mystery behind the modified humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode</strong>: pure mayhem with nonstop enemies and bullets flying everywhere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready: <strong>there\u2019s only one rule \u2014 kill them all.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003520?t=1757431437","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003520?t=1757431437","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003520/fa2851a7b04dbe20197bbd4333a67c6597f19a7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757431437","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003520/fa2851a7b04dbe20197bbd4333a67c6597f19a7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757431437","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Play